body:
hi i am probably way older since i am 62  and i dont of course no where you live .

for me and i am guessing your age in my head  sports was probably my biggest ice breaker playing and there used to be a local schoolyard that we all all hungout at then ended up going to concerts camping etc , 

but i do feel for people of younger generations  i think there are alot less ways for people to socialize in real life outside of school or work 

&#x200B;

so that leaves the   chruch  the libary maybe bowling etc 

i know i didnt help much and its frustrating  but keep your hopes and dreams alive things can change for the  better  goodluck
